[{"answer":"Many people admire the paintings and sculptures that artists create.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Some very beautiful paintings and sculptures were created by two men","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/2.mp3"},{"answer":"who lived in the same country at the same time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/3.mp3"},{"answer":"These men were Leonardo da Vinci and Michelangelo.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/4.mp3"},{"answer":"They both lived in Italy around the year 1500.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Leonardo da Vinci is most famous for his painting called the Mona Lisa.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/6.mp3"},{"answer":"This is perhaps the best-known painting in the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/7.mp3"},{"answer":"The Mona Lisa shows the head and shoulders of a dark-haired woman.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/8.mp3"},{"answer":"When people look at this painting, they are often captivated by her smile","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and by her eyes, which have a look of mystery.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Another painting of Leonardo's is called The Last Supper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/11.mp3"},{"answer":"This painting shows a famous scene from the Christian religion.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/12.mp3"},{"answer":"In this painting, Jesus Christ is seated at the middle of a long table,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/13.mp3"},{"answer":"with his followers (the disciples) seated around him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Many of the paintings that were created at this time have a religious theme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Leonardo was not only an artist; he was also interested in engineering.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/16.mp3"},{"answer":"He actually worked for some time as an adviser to a military leader,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/17.mp3"},{"answer":"helping him to develop new machines for use in war.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Leonardo also made rough drawings of machines","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/19.mp3"},{"answer":"that are similar to those that were invented much later,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/20.mp3"},{"answer":"such as submarines and helicopters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Obviously, Leonardo was an extremely creative man.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Michelangelo was about 23 years younger than Leonardo.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/23.mp3"},{"answer":"In addition to being a painter,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Michelangelo was also a sculptor,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and many experts consider him the greatest sculptor of all time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/26.mp3"},{"answer":"One of his most famous sculptures is David,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/27.mp3"},{"answer":"which is a statue of a young man who was a famous figure in the Bible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Another great sculpture of Michelangelo is called the Pieta.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/29.mp3"},{"answer":"The Pieta shows Mary, mother of Jesus, holding the baby of her son across her lap.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Michelangelo is also famous for painting the ceiling of a church known as the Sistine Chapel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/31.mp3"},{"answer":"The leader of the Roman Catholic Church, Pope Julius,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/32.mp3"},{"answer":"asked Michelangelo to paint the ceiling of this new church.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/33.mp3"},{"answer":"This project required many years of hard work,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and the Pope complained that it took too long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/35.mp3"},{"answer":"However, when the work was finished,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/36.mp3"},{"answer":"the ceiling of the Sistine Chapel was covered with beautiful paintings","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/37.mp3"},{"answer":"of many scenes from the Bible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Fortunately, many of the works of Leonardo and of Michelangelo","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/39.mp3"},{"answer":"can still be seen today in art galleries of Europe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/40.mp3"},{"answer":"During the past 500 years,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/41.mp3"},{"answer":"the color of the paintings had faded somewhat,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/42.mp3"},{"answer":"but in recent years,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/43.mp3"},{"answer":"some work has been done to restore the paintings to their original appearance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/168-two-great-artists-leonardo-and-michelangelo-2019-04-07-04-38-59/44.mp3"}]
